    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686000/extras/99438ab842f0516577e047d22519f3f2.avif?t=1752500919\" width=616 height=292 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Return to Earth Atlantis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to dive into Earth Atlantis 2, a thrilling post-apocalyptic SHMUP with Metroidvania-style exploration, set in a vast sunken world overrun by machine-hybrid sea monsters. Pilot a heavily armed submarine through relentless bullet-hell chaos, hunting over 20 colossal bosses\u2014from a rock-armored crab to an ancient Megalodon\u2014in heart-pounding bullet-hell battles across 9 interconnected stages. Explore a vibrant post-apocalyptic underwater world far larger than before, spanning submerged forests, drowned New York cityscapes, ancient Egyptian pyramids, and the ruins of lost Atlantis. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a breathtaking brand new pixel art style, Earth Atlantis 2 delivers intense bullet-hell action packed with epic sea monster showdowns, innovative drone systems, stunning visuals, and unforgettable undersea exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686000/extras/f6529b012895e8e489b3e5081941d30c.avif?t=1752500919\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the dawn of the 22nd century, oceans covering 96% of Earth\u2019s surface have swallowed human civilization. Post-apocalyptic ruins lie buried in the abyss. Machines once built to serve humanity have evolved into ferocious machine-hybrid sea monsters, ruling the depths. As a legendary submarine captain, you must hunt these terrifying creatures in relentless bullet-hell clashes, uncover lost secrets beneath the abyss, and fight to save humanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic  Boss Battles:</strong><br>Fight over 20 colossal machine-hybrid sea monsters, each featuring intricate behaviors, unique attack patterns, and multi-stage encounters that demand sharp reflexes and precise tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgraded Gameplay:</strong><br>Master the all-new Drone system, unlocking diverse formations and upgrades to suit any situation and unleashing devastating special blasts for critical strikes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686000/extras/f8bee7dd7ecd3830f817ce1abc5d9675.poster.avif?t=1752500919\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686000/extras/f8bee7dd7ecd3830f817ce1abc5d9675.webm?t=1752500919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686000/extras/f8bee7dd7ecd3830f817ce1abc5d9675.mp4?t=1752500919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686000/extras/6823b1ede5a4db844297bd58a2dccf93.poster.avif?t=1752500919\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686000/extras/6823b1ede5a4db844297bd58a2dccf93.webm?t=1752500919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686000/extras/6823b1ede5a4db844297bd58a2dccf93.mp4?t=1752500919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686000/extras/c57fb63c0a7744b9e8fd63071f8fd0db.poster.avif?t=1752500919\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686000/extras/c57fb63c0a7744b9e8fd63071f8fd0db.webm?t=1752500919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686000/extras/c57fb63c0a7744b9e8fd63071f8fd0db.mp4?t=1752500919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vast Post-Apocalyptic Sunken World:</strong><br>Explore a sprawling free-roaming map across 9 stages, from submerged New York to sunken Egyptian pyramids and fabled Atlantis. Uncover ancient artifacts, battle machine-hybrid sea monster ambushes, and unlock powerful upgrades in a dynamic post-apocalyptic seascape of forested depths and ancient ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breathtaking Visuals:</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a vibrant post-apocalyptic underwater world brought to life with a stunning new pixel art style, blending retro charm with modern visual flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686000/extras/200f2e57f1c5f459690fda5c815d5198.avif?t=1752500919\" data-has-big width=800 height=417 /></span></p></li></ul>",
