"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic  Boss Battles:</strong><br>Fight over 20 colossal machine-hybrid sea monsters, each featuring intricate behaviors, unique attack patterns, and multi-stage encounters that demand sharp reflexes and precise tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgraded Gameplay:</strong><br>Master the all-new Drone system, unlocking diverse formations and upgrades to suit any situation and unleashing devastating special blasts for critical strikes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686000/extras/f8bee7dd7ecd3830f817ce1abc5d9675.poster.avif?t=1752500919\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686000/extras/f8bee7dd7ecd3830f817ce1abc5d9675.webm?t=1752500919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686000/extras/f8bee7dd7ecd3830f817ce1abc5d9675.mp4?t=1752500919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686000/extras/6823b1ede5a4db844297bd58a2dccf93.poster.avif?t=1752500919\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686000/extras/6823b1ede5a4db844297bd58a2dccf93.webm?t=1752500919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686000/extras/6823b1ede5a4db844297bd58a2dccf93.mp4?t=1752500919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati